UID:iui-2027-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270212
SUMMARY:IUI 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM Conference on Intelligent User Interfaces\nStatus: confirme
 d\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://iui.acm.org/2027/\nVenue
  Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#iui-2027\nNotes: Official 
 IUI 2027 pages confirm Feb 8-11\, 2027 at Helsinki Congress Paasitorni\; 
 all deadlines are end of day AoE. Papers closed Aug 20 after the Aug 13 a
 bstract registration in PCS. Still ahead on Oct 31: workshop papers (Nov 
 9 common date\, matched on 7 of 8 workshop sites\, each with its own CFP\
 ; joint CEUR-or-similar proceedings) and 4-page posters and demos (Nov 10
 \; companion proceedings). Portals not checked. ACM DL papers are open ac
 cess\, with an APC outside ACM Open unless waived\; one author must prese
 nt in person. IUI 2026 moved from March to July 13-16 (Limassol). Size M 
 from 113 listed IUI 2026 papers plus posters and demos. Size is an editor
 ial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Human-AI Interaction & Deployment,Explainability & Interpretabil
 ity,Natural Language Processing & LLMs,Recommender Systems
URL:https://iui.acm.org/2027/
LOCATION:Helsinki\, Finland
END:VEVENT
